<br><b>&lt;supra&gt;</b> will have / already do have
<br><b>&lt;supra&gt;</b> NPCs and monsters have very similar movement restrictions to normal players
<br><b>&lt;supra&gt;</b> So if a player can't walk through the wall, neither can the NPC or monster.
<br><b>&lt;EolirinXianve&gt;</b> You cannot have a siege if you cannot block entry...
